摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"After installation, open Settings → API Usage in DeepSeek Harness to view your DeepSeek API usage. The page shows your account balance, estimated spend, token counts, and API request count over the last 24 hours (14 days in the daily view), rendered as a timeline bar chart simila","id":"gh:1333260502","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"ds-api-usage","slug":"Sev7een/ds-api-usage","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"After installation, open Settings → API Usage in DeepSeek Harness to view your DeepSeek API usage. T"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"he page shows your account balance, estimated spend, token counts, and API request count over the la"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"st 24 hours (14 days in the daily view), rendered as a timeline bar chart simila"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DHS API Usage — DeepSeek Harness plugin"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** | 简体中文 | Português (Brasil)"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"After installation, open **Settings → API Usage** in DeepSeek Harness to view your DeepSeek API usag"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"e. The page shows your account balance, estimated spend, token counts, and API request count over th"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"e last 24 hours (14 days in the daily view), rendered as a timeline bar chart similar to the officia"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"l DeepSeek platform usage page."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- 💰 **Balance card** — total balance with granted / topped-up split, labeled with the API-reported c"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"urrency code (CNY or USD), plus an availability badge, fetched from the official `GET /user/balance`"},{"id":"p6s3","text":" endpoint.\n- 📊 **Metric cards** — 24h estimated spend (CNY), token counts (input / output split), an"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"d API request count.\n- 📈 **Timeline chart** — hourly bars over the last 24 hours, or daily bars over"},{"id":"p6s5","text":" 14 days, toggled between cost, tokens, and request counts (hover for exact values).\n- 🔄 **Live refr"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"esh** — balance refreshes every 60 s on the host; the page polls every 30 s and has a manual refresh"},{"id":"p6s7","text":" button.\n- 🔑 **No extra key setup** — reuses the deployment's existing `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` credential"},{"id":"p6s8","text":" through the harness `credentials` service."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### Data notes"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **Token counts are real** — they come from the `usage` chunk of every streaming model call (`Strea"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"mChunk` with `type: 'usage'`, `TokenUsage`), the same provider-reported numbers the harness itself u"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"ses for session stats.\n- **Cost is an estimate** — CNY is computed from DeepSeek's public list price"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"s (模型 & 价格) in the generated `PRICING` table (`src/index.js`), applied per model:\n- cache hit input "},{"id":"p10s5","text":"→ `hit` price\n- cache miss input → `miss` price\n- output → `output` price\n- cache write is not bille"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"d separately by DeepSeek and is excluded.\n- since 2026-08-16 DeepSeek bills peak / off-peak: models "},{"id":"p10s7","text":"with `peak` / `offPeak` rates are priced by the request's UTC hour (windows in `peakHoursUtc`; 01:00"},{"id":"p10s8","text":"–04:00 and 06:00–10:00 UTC); the rest use their `flat` rate.\n- **Persisted aggregation** — hourly bu"},{"id":"p10s9","text":"ckets keep 48 h, daily keep 14 d, persisted to `$DSH_HOME/storages/ds-api-usage.json` (writes deboun"},{"id":"p10s10","text":"ced to at most one per 60 s, flushed on plugin shutdown, fail-safe: a read/write error never breaks "},{"id":"p10s11","text":"accounting). The 14-day view therefore survives web-app restarts; delete the file to reset. The harn"},{"id":"p10s12","text":"ess separately keeps its own durable per-session token projection."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Via `dsh plugin add` (recommended, from GitHub or npm)"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Install directly from this GitHub repository:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"or, once published to npm:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"`dsh plugin` forwards to pnpm in the profile directory and reconciles the\npackage into the profile's"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" bundle list (`dsh.profile.bundles`). The package's\n`cordis.patch.yml` (declared via `dsh.bundle.pat"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ch` in `package.json`) then\ninserts the plugin row into the host composition, and the `dsh.client`\nd"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"eclaration makes the web shell load `client/bundle.js` as the settings page."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### As a dynamic plugin (dev / session-scoped)"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The original is a dynamic Cordis plugin, created per session with `cordis_define` / `cordis_run` (se"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"e the DeepSeek Harness docs). The `code.host` body is `src/index.js` minus the `module.exports` wrap"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"per; the `code.client` body is `client/index.js` minus the wrapper."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"> Note: the dynamic form uses the sandbox-private `harness.handle` / `host.call` channel (`client/in"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"dex.js`), while the static bundle form (`client/bundle.js`) talks to the host over the HTTP route `/"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ds-api-usage/snapshot`. Keep both in sync when changing the protocol."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### As a composition plugin (persistent, manual)"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Add a row to the host composition (`cordis.patch.yml` of your profile):"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"or, without installing the package, by a relative path to this repository. The plugin is *host-plane"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"*: it reads the host `credentials`, `subprocess`, `timer`, and `webServer` services and registers th"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"e client settings page in the root-scoped `settings.section` slot, so it should live in the **host c"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"omposition**, not inside an agent preset."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### Requirements"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness with the DeepSeek LLM adapter configured (`DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` credential resolvabl"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"e via the `credentials` service)\n- `curl` available on the host for the balance endpoint\n- A browser"},{"id":"p26s3","text":" client with the settings sidebar (for the UI)"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- Prices are auto-tracked: `.github/workflows/update-pricing.yml` (daily cron + manual dispatch) re-"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"parses the official pricing pages and opens a PR when the table changes; `npm run update:pricing` do"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"es the same locally (`--apply` writes the generated block in `src/index.js`). Edit the table only th"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"rough the script — the block between the `__PRICING_BEGIN__` / `__PRICING_END__` markers is generate"},{"id":"p29s5","text":"d.\n- The client localizes through the harness `locale` service (namespace `settings.ds-api-usage`) a"},{"id":"p29s6","text":"nd follows the harness's active locale: dictionaries ship for the harness's `zh`/`en` ids plus a `pt"},{"id":"p29s7","text":"-BR` entry for future harness support (keys missing in the active locale fall back to `zh`)."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## CI / GitHub Actions"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"The repository ships two workflows — no secrets or API keys are required, and the only prerequisite "},{"id":"p31s2","text":"is GitHub Actions being enabled for the repository (default; check **Settings → Actions → General → "},{"id":"p31s3","text":"Allow all actions**):"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"- **`ci.yml`** — runs on every push and pull request: `npm run check` (syntax of both halves) and `n"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"pm test` (offline test suite with page fixtures).\n- **`update-pricing.yml`** — re-parses the officia"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"l DeepSeek pricing pages every day (06:23 UTC cron) and on manual dispatch (**Actions → update-prici"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"ng → Run workflow**). When the table changes it opens a PR with the regenerated block (the workflow "},{"id":"p32s5","text":"declares `contents: write` and `pull-requests: write` on the default `GITHUB_TOKEN` — nothing to con"},{"id":"p32s6","text":"figure). If the docs page is restructured, the parser validation fails and the job fails loudly inst"},{"id":"p32s7","text":"ead of opening a bad PR."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
